  "difficulty_level": "H2",
  "difficulty_reason": "The construction replaces ordered etale Cech intersections by unordered configurations while retaining integral coefficients and the sign local system. Its proof must identify exterior-power sheaves with configuration-space sign coinvariants, build the character line sheaf on a finite-group quotient, and compare two injective double-complex spectral sequences. This geometric and derived construction goes beyond a routine Cech-cover computation, and does not assume exactness of group anti-invariants.",
